<%- include('../partials/site-head', { title: 'About Northline' }) %>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="label">About Northline</div>
    <h1>A home services company you can count on.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Northline Home &amp; Outdoor helps homeowners maintain, improve and refresh their properties — inside and out.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="label">Who we are</div>
      <h2 style="margin:12px 0 18px">Professional quality at a fair price.</h2>
      <p>We’re not trying to be the cheapest company in town, and we’re not charging luxury prices either. Our goal is simple: give you an organized, punctual, professional company without inflated prices.</p>
      <p>Instead of calling a different contractor for the lawn, the paint, the driveway and the deck, you can call one company. That’s Northline.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card reveal">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:16px">Why homeowners choose us</h3>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><%- icon('check') %><span>Uniformed, respectful crews</span></li>
        <li><%- icon('check') %><span>Confirmed appointments and clear communication</span></li>
        <li><%- icon('check') %><span>Professional written estimates</span></li>
        <li><%- icon('check') %><span>We clean up before we leave</span></li>
        <li><%- icon('check') %><span>One company for many jobs around your home</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section dark">
  <div class="container grid g3">
    <div class="pillar reveal"><span class="medal"><%- icon('shield') %></span><div><h3>Quality Work</h3><p>Attention to detail.</p></div></div>
    <div class="pillar reveal"><span class="medal"><%- icon('sprout') %></span><div><h3>Premium Materials</h3><p>Long-lasting results.</p></div></div>
    <div class="pillar reveal"><span class="medal"><%- icon('users') %></span><div><h3>Residential Experts</h3><p>Clean, respectful &amp; reliable.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow center reveal">
    <div class="label rule">Our vision</div>
    <h2 style="margin:14px 0 18px">“I need work done around my house.”</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto">When a homeowner says that, we want Northline to be the first call — for painting, landscaping, remodeling, pressure washing, decks and fences.</p>
  </div>
</section>
